  "fullDescription": "Step into a cheerful holiday village with Tiny Christmas Shops, a cozy coloring book filled with charming little stores, festive market stalls, and heartwarming Christmas scenes.\n\nExplore delightful holiday shops decorated with wreaths, garlands, bows, Christmas trees, ornaments, lights, and snowy details. From cozy flower and gift shops to festive craft stalls and other tiny storefronts, each illustration captures the warmth and wonder of wandering through a magical Christmas market during the holiday season.\n\nDesigned with bold outlines and large coloring spaces, every page offers an easy, relaxing, and enjoyable coloring experience with plenty of cozy Christmas charm.\n\n• 30 unique coloring designs\n• Charming tiny Christmas shops\n• Cozy holiday stores and market stalls\n• Bold and easy-to-color outlines\n• Large and comfortable coloring spaces\n• Wreaths, garlands, bows, trees, and ornaments\n• Festive storefronts and Christmas decorations\n• Cozy indoor and outdoor holiday scenes\n• Cheerful Christmas village atmosphere\n• High-quality printable designs",
